### When anonymous user creates new game 401 is returned

POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/internal/games
Content-Type: application/json

{
}

### When admin creates new game with invalid request, 400 is returned and descriptive message is returned

POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/internal/games
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic admin admin

{
  "name": "The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt",
  "developer": "CD Projekt Red",
  "description": "Example description",
  "baseGameId": 2,
  "publisher": "Cd projekt",
  "releaseDate": "2015-05-19",
  "avgRating": 0,
  "basePrice": "60.00",
  "discountedPrice": null,
  "discountedUntil": null,
  "reviewCount": 0,
  "releaseStatus": "RELEASED",
  "platforms": [
    "Pc"
  ],
  "tags": [
    "Open world",
    "Singleplayer"
  ],
  "languages": [
    "English",
    "Polish"
  ],
