### When admin wants to create a game with the same combination of name x developer x release date - 409 is returned

POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/internal/games
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic admin admin

{
  "name": "The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt",
  "developer": "CD Projekt Red",
  "releaseDate": "2015-05-19",
  "description": "Example description",
  "publisher": "CD Projekt"
}



### When Admin wants to apply discount and resulting price is greater than base price - 400 is returned

PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/internal/games/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic admin admin

{
  "discountedPrice": "80"
}

### When Admin wants to patch non existing game - 404 is returned

PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/internal/games/2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic admin admin

{
  "name": "Cyberpunk 2077"
}

### When anonymous user patches game - 401 is returned

PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/internal/games/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
"discountedPrice": "80"
}

### When admin user deletes game - 204 is returned

DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/internal/games/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic admin admin

### When anonymous user deletes game - 401 is returned

DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/internal/games/1
Content-Type: application/json